{'symbol': 'AIZ', 'date': '2022-01-11 16:20:00', 'title': 'ASSURANT BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.68 PER COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ASSURANT, INC. (NYSE: AIZ), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF LIFESTYLE AND HOUSING SOLUTIONS THAT SUPPORT, PROTECT AND CONNECT MAJOR CONSUMER PURCHASES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.68 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON MARCH 21, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 28, 2022. FUTURE DIVIDEND DECLARATIONS WILL BE MADE AT THE DISCRETION OF THE ASSURANT BOARD OF DIREC'}